        "step": "estimates",
        "x": "Views are the volume (thousands a second); clicks are the money (hundreds)."
      },
      {
        "step": "api",
        "x": "POST a batch of events, each with an id the app made (so a resend isn't counted twice); GET stats per minute."
      },
      {
        "step": "design",
        "x": "Accept events into a durable event stream partitioned by ad; a stream processor keeps each minute's total and writes it by its key, so an event read twice after a restart still counts once."
      },
      {
        "step": "design",
        "x": "If a counter crashes, the queue still has the events: nothing accepted is lost."
      },
      {
        "step": "design",
